      "position": "Attacking Midfielder / Right Wing",
      "badge": "Captain",
      "note": "The elder statesman of this squad and its heartbeat. After years at Newcastle where he became a fan legend for his tireless running, Almirón returned to MLS to finish his career but his commitment to the national team has never wavered. His energy and experience provide exactly what a counter-attacking side needs."
